              "name": "nicnaknut"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A great and easy recipe! I had some left over grape juice from my grapes in my garden so I used that juice with some cranberry juice from the store... My jellies turned out so yummy and I plan on giving some out at our family reunion... I can't wait to try this recipe with other flavors of juice... The pomegranate and cranberry sounds awesome!",
